ffect(_:options:isactive:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/symbolEffect(_:options:isActive:)":{"title":"symbolEffect(_:options:isActive:)","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolEffect"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Symbols19SymbolEffectOptionsV","text":"SymbolEffectOptions"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isActive"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","p